    "Required-only frequency applies to the imported-case solver. Generic core factory defaults are unchanged.",
    "Generator buses, configured remote signals and requested outputs remain covered; unknown consumers keep all buses. Wiring/output membership changes require reinitialization or explicit ALL coverage.",
